# --- Generated weekly media is NOT versioned -------------------------------
# Rationale: ~15 MB/week would reach ~800 MB/year. The media's archive home is
# the GitHub approval Issue (attachments are permanent and viewable there) and
# the platforms themselves. What the engine actually needs for week-to-week
# variety is the CONCEPTS, which live in captions.md — and those ARE versioned.
content/weekly/**/*.png
content/weekly/**/*.jpg
content/weekly/**/*.jpeg
content/weekly/**/*.mp4
content/weekly/**/*.mov

# Keep every captions.md and QC block
!content/weekly/**/captions.md

# Keep the small per-platform exports (~200 KB each). These are what the approval
# Issue links to, and they are the durable record of what the week actually was.
# The multi-MB master PNGs stay out — they live in the run artifact for 30 days.
!content/weekly/**/*__4x5.jpg
!content/weekly/**/*__2x3.jpg
!content/weekly/**/*__9x16.jpg
!content/weekly/**/bundle.json

# --- Secrets: never commit. GitHub Actions secrets only. --------------------
.env
*.key
*_token*
credentials*.json

# --- Scratch ---------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
tmp/
out/
